<div class="container">
<div class="head"><h2 id="record-title">Twenty-five years of building software, the last twelve as a founder-CTO.</h2></div>
<ol class="timeline">
<li><div><h3>Datamaran</h3><span class="when">12 years</span></div><p>Co-founder and CTO of an ESG regulatory intelligence SaaS. Built product, engineering and data science from zero to about 50 people, through Series A, B and C and an exit. Led the move from rule-based NLP to LLMs, and ran the Innovation Lab for agentic development.</p></li>
<li><div><h3>ZS Associates</h3><span class="when">11 years, New York</span></div><p>Product manager and lead architect of a life-sciences analytics SaaS platform. Led data and marketing-analytics centres of excellence.</p></li>
<li><div><h3>Teaching and mentoring</h3></div><p>Lecturer on AI and emerging technology at Audencia. Mentor with Plato and All Tech Is Human.</p></li>
<li><div><h3>Hands-on, every day</h3></div><p>Building with agents daily since December 2025. We operate the model we ask clients to adopt.</p></li>
</ol>
</div>
</section>

<section class="sec--l band" aria-labelledby="how-title">
<div class="container">
<div class="head"><h2 id="how-title">Senior people, assembled per project.</h2><p class="lead">A core of senior operators and a vetted network, assembled per project.</p></div>
<ul class="trio">
<li><h3>A core of senior operators</h3><p>Every engagement is led by someone who has run engineering through the AI transition.</p></li>
<li><h3>A vetted network</h3><p>Specialists brought in only when the work needs them, never to fill a team.</p></li>
<li><h3>Operating discipline</h3><p>A weekly executive status, monthly goals, and a knowledge repository for each client.</p></li>
</ul>
