</section>

<section class="sec" aria-labelledby="name-title">
<div class="container split">
<div>
<h2 id="name-title" class="statement">Passarel·la means footbridge.</h2>
<p class="lead">In Valencian and Catalan, a passarel·la is a light footbridge. It is a good picture of the job: a route from where you are to where you want to be, walked by your team, with a guide who knows the way. Founded in Valencia, working across France, Spain, the UK and the wider EU.</p>
</div>
